#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:28
#: 5aecde8fe2e14729a7e94a19e877358a
msgid "图中 `pbe` 只对应 PBE 数据："
msgstr "The `pbe` setting shown here applies only to PBE data:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:30
#: 2b7cc69f50b84b5ea6638d0dc37dc06a
msgid "第一项填写原始 DFT 计算使用的泛函，例如 `pbe`、`scan` 或 `pbesol`。"
msgstr ""
"In the first field, enter the functional used by the original DFT "
"calculation, such as `pbe`, `scan`, or `pbesol`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:31
#: 4a540994e69e46d39cf82ebc746a5c19
msgid ""
"`D3 cutoff` 和 `D3 cutoff_cn` 第一次先保留当前默认值；只有已有计算规范明确要"
"求时才修改。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the current defaults for `D3 cutoff` and `D3 cutoff_cn` on your first "
"run. Change them only when an established calculation protocol explicitly "
"requires different values."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:32
#: 2f3ebdd637124102aaa27799ede316eb
msgid "按目标选择 `Add DFT-D3` 或 `Subtract DFT-D3`。"
msgstr ""
"Choose `Add DFT-D3` or `Subtract DFT-D3` according to the target convention."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:33
#: fa259a9edf1948cea187d65e32ffa91e
msgid "点击 `OK`，等待全部结构处理完成。"
msgstr "Click `OK` and wait for all structures to be processed."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:35
#: a477c724ea3248d9ab5b04084d928c77
msgid ""
"不要因为模型使用了某种泛函就填写那个名称；这里应与当前 DFT 标签的原始计算口径"
"一致。"
msgstr ""
"Do not enter a functional merely because the model uses it. This field must "
"match the convention of the original DFT labels in the current dataset."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:37
#: a5bd9ecb53bb416ebeb662a731f8b4b6
msgid "3. 看标签是否按预期改变"
msgstr "3. Check that the labels changed as intended"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:39
#: 419ed4396d5b4e219b95db31dcc9717d
msgid "加上 PBE DFT-D3 后的能量图"
msgstr "Energy plot after adding PBE DFT-D3"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:39
#: 419ed4396d5b4e219b95db31dcc9717d
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/dft_d3_result.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/dft_d3_result.png"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:44
#: 7c8a810b9c53435a9a35ba5e20e58c46
msgid ""
"本例真实加上了 PBE DFT-D3，因此参考能量、力和 virial 发生变化，NEP 预测本身没"
"有改变。散点更靠近或更远离对角线都不能单独证明操作正确；关键是模式、泛函和原"
"数据口径是否匹配。"
msgstr ""
"This example applies a real PBE DFT-D3 correction, so the reference energy, "
"force, and virial change while the NEP predictions remain unchanged. Points "
"moving closer to or farther from the diagonal does not by itself prove that "
"the operation is correct. What matters is whether the mode, functional, and "
"source-data convention match."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/example/dft-d3-correction.md:46
#: ec421fbacf254cd387db9a2bbfc95f0f
msgid ""
"检查完成后用新文件名导出，例如 `train_pbe_d3.xyz`。不要覆盖无法重新获得的原始"
"标签。"
msgstr ""
"After checking the result, export it under a new name such as "
"`train_pbe_d3.xyz`. Do not overwrite original labels that cannot be "
"reproduced."
